'''Grimy buchu leaf''' is a [[herb]] found within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It can be grown with a [[Farming]] level of 39, by planting [[buchu seed]]s in [[Herb_patch_(Chambers_of_Xeric)|herb patches]] found within resource rooms. It must be cleaned into a [[buchu leaf]] before it can be used to brew potions, and requires 52 [[Herblore]] to be cleaned.

